; Issue 2 minimal repro (FIXED): a boolean-result infix must NOT be turned
; into an option capture chain.
;
; Before fix, LLVM verification failed with:
;   '%lv.65' defined with type '%option = type { i64, [3 x i64] }' but expected 'i1'
;     %c40 = xor i1 1, %lv.65
;
; Workaround that also worked before the fix: `b bool = lb == 10`.
s = 'hello'
lb = s[0]
b = lb == 10
! b -> print('y')
